  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young Africa Innovates (YAI) (Ghana) aims to nurture a large, diverse population of young people to develop innovative solutions to critical social challenges. YAI will test the strategic hypothesis that creating an inclusive and repeatable process to seek out and foster atypical actors is critical to unlocking new solutions and unearthing jobs at scale. In the context of YAI, atypical actors are youth from the following population groups: rural, low English literacy, no experience of receiving</narrative>
  </description>
